      <yt-formatted-string class="style-scope ytd-expandable-metadata-renderer">The animals of Animal Farm discuss the lack of electricity and the potential benefits of constructing a watermill. JoBlo Animation 4K presents this scene where the pigs attempt to adopt human characteristics, challenging established rules and changing the social dynamics among the farm inhabitants.</yt-formatted-string>
